  "post_content": "<p>Este viernes se ha celebrado en el colegio Virgen del Carmen de Onda una mesa redonda dentro de los actos conmemorativos del 50 aniversario del actual centro educativo.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/11/IMG_3466.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Directivos, antiguos alumnos, antiguas alumnas y personal de administraci&oacute;n servicios han relatado los recuerdos de su estancia en el colegio.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taularredona50anysvergedelcarme/img_3453.jpg\" alt=\"img_3453\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taularredona50anysvergedelcarme/img_3454.jpg\" alt=\"img_3454\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taularredona50anysvergedelcarme/img_3456.jpg\" alt=\"img_3456\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taularredona50anysvergedelcarme/img_3457.jpg\" alt=\"img_3457\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taularredona50anysvergedelcarme/img_3458.jpg\" alt=\"img_3458\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taularredona50anysvergedelcarme/img_3459.jpg\" alt=\"img_3459\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taularredona50anysvergedelcarme/img_3460.jpg\" alt=\"img_3460\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taularredona50anysvergedelcarme/img_3461.jpg\" alt=\"img_3461\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taularredona50anysve